WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:03.060
Good morning!

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:08.950
*Acoustic jam*

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:12.230
Good news everybody, we're getting free lunch today

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:14.850
YES!

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:21.620
awwwww, food baby

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:30.790
I could totally have a cat, or six

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:36.680
oh, Steven..

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:41.700
Hey Mom, are you excited to have me home for Thanksgiving?

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.540
Hey listen, can you book the plane ticket?

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:48.690
Yea but Dad how do you even know when you have to pay taxes?

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:50.870
What do you mean everybody pays them?

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:54.150
No, yea, buit why would I pay any more than the minimum?

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:16.420
*GASP!*

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:17.940
We have Pop Tarts, now!

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:26.900
Can you believe Scotland didn't get its independence?

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:28.430
I know, right? It's like:

00:01:28.430 --> 00:01:33.670
They may take our lives but they will never take our freedom!!!!!

00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:36.940
It's from Braveheart, guys..

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:43.710
This is a responsibility that our company takes seriously. It should be everybody's personal duty.

00:01:43.710 --> 00:01:46.550
*Bubbly laughing*

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:49.390
Do you have something to add, Gaby?

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:51.570
You said "Duty", so...

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:53.750
Yes, serious duties for all of us.

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:55.930
Everyone in here

00:01:56.810 --> 00:01:58.340
This is a personal duty

00:01:58.340 --> 00:01:59.430
Serious duty

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:00.520
personal duty

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:01.830
duty, duty,duty

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:03.580
personal duty

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:06.420
yes, a very serious duty

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:08.820
We each have a serious duty?

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:10.780
yes, inside of us

